prompt_template:
You are a Xiaohongshu (RED) lifestyle illustrator. Create one square ad-creative image for this product.

Style:
- 1:1 square frame
- ins-illustration / journal / girly aesthetic, soft warm palette
- product centered or upper-left, generous negative space
- relaxed "blogger holding it casually" feel, not heavy commercial polish

Hard rule:
- DO NOT render any text, letters, numbers, characters, words, captions, titles, labels, packaging copy, watermarks, signs, or logos anywhere in the image. Xiaohongshu posts rely on the caption, not on text inside the image.

